ate_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"I do not agree with the change you did to the condition from the original PR. Yes it does fix the crash you describe, but it is not a good way to address it.\n\nThe specific crash you mentioned has https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119057 as root cause. This is an issue in the implementation of `Script::reload(true)` where newly added members don't get properly initialized. You are trying to fix it in an editor specific way, which could hide such issues until a game is exported.\n\nThe code here should be limited to handling the conversion between placeholders and actual instances. The in-place update of instances might be broken, but that needs to be fixed as part of `Script::reload`.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368#pullrequestreview-5060464393","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116368","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-30T10:12:17Z"},{"id":5174585786,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNG3pug","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"c860796bf0628de24fd69c019efc29db6e98de2c","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?u=a3ed7540f46720cbf73f01b590fd1ef225d39344&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","login":"ColinSORourke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368#pullrequestreview-5174585786","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116368","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-09-11T03:01:31Z"},{"id":517683